    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahisofeeli ongeja kūng'wīla ū Abusalomu, “Nizunīlījage nasolanhye banhū shihūmbī ikūmi na shibīlī nabūūke ū būjikū wa lelo yenīyī nankūūbīje ū Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūja nakang'wisanganīje aho ataalī asedeekile na anogile, nang'wibakīje abbahe, bampeele pye a banhū abo balī hamò nang'hwe. Ū nene nakūntūla ū ntemi dūhū, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nūkwenhela a banhū. Ū munhū ūyo ūlīnkooba ūlū ūcha bakūshoka dūhū a banhū, nīyo pye bakūbiza balī mhola.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyo gūnyeja ū Abusalomu na a banamhala ba Isilaeli a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Abusalomu ūhaya, “Aling'witanagi nū Hushai ū muna Aliki, tūng'wigwe nang'hwe ū būhayi wakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hushai aho washika ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Abusalomu, ū Abusalomu ūhaya, “Ū Ahisofeeli wahayaga twīte gīkī na gīkī, ūlībona kinehe, twīte ūmo wahayīlaga? Ūlū ītī chene twinhage nang'ho ū būganikīji wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hushai ūhaya, “A maganiko ga ng'wa Ahisofeeli gatī gawiza ī likanza īlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūndeebile ūmo alī ū so na a banhū bakwe; ūmanile gīkī a boi balī banhū ba būlūgū ba shikū ningī, nīyo ī haha basaayaga no gītī ndūba yīngījiagwa baana bayo. Hama a higūlya ya henaho ūmanile gīkī ū so ayīmanīīlile ī mihayo ya būlūgū, ū būjikū wenūbū atūbiza ho a ha banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo nūūlū nī haha wamalaga kūbiswa ng'wihalo ilebe, nūūlū alī ipandī līngī. Hama a banhū abo balaatonge ū kūbūlagwa, ū lūkumo lūkūsambaala hose pyī; gīkī, ‘Bashila kūcha a banhū ba ng'wa Abusalomu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a henaho nūūlū ūbiza alīho nshilikale wa ng'holò gītī ya shimba, akwaaba gītī būgondo kūlwa kogoha, nguno pye a Baisilaeli bamanile gīkī ū so ng'wene munhū wa būlūgū, na a babo balī kū lwandī lwakwe bakaja shū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nidegelekage nane a maganiko gane; gīkī, pye a Baisilaeli babilingwe kwandīja Dani kūshisha Beeli-sheba. Bize a halī bebe bingī gete gītī maseni ga ha ng'walo gwa nyanza, hūna ūbatongeele bebe ng'wenekīlī ū kū būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūje tūkūnkobyaga hose hose ūko alabize wibisaga, tūkang'wikīīle gītī lūme kwika hasī; atūpīla nūūlū hado pye na a banhū bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wihamba kūpeelela kū nzengo nebe, a henaho pye a Baisilaeli bakwiza gītī balī na ngoye j'igokoolo, bagūholomole ū nzengo gwenūyo pye gete kūja kū longa; katizūsaaga ho nūūlū kamenyulwa kado k'iwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abusalomu na a Baisilaeli a bose būhaya, “A maganiko ga ng'wa Hushai ū muna Aliki gabeela kūtinda a ga ng'wa Ahisofeeli.” Īkaja gīko nguno ū SEEBA walī wahela gīkī a kahelele ka ng'wa Ahisofeeli kabipiwe, ū Abusalomu agwīlwe mhayo gwabūbi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūhūgūlwa wangū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Hushai ūbawīla a bagabīji, ū Sadoki nū Abiasaali; ūhaya, “Ū Ahisofeeli walī wang'wīla ū Abusalomu na a banamhala ba Isilaeli kwīta gīkī na gīkī, alīyo ū nene nūbawīla hambū hambū ūlū kwīta gīkī na gīkī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, twalagi mhola ī haha ū kūlī Daūdi, mung'wīle gīkī, ‘Ūtizūshika a ha būkīlīlo wa mongo ū ng'wikūngū ūlaale henaho, kīlaga gete ī lelo yenīyī, yaya ū kwilewa; ūlū wilewa īkūbipa ī mihayo, ū ntemi akūmilwa, pye na a banhū abo alī nabo!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A basūmba a ba Yonasani nū Ahimaazi baalī baalenda Enilogeni; baalindīīlīlaga kwenūko ī mihayo, a boi yalī yaya gete ū kūbonwa balingīla ū mu nzengo. Walīho ng'wanikī ntūmami walī wasolwa kūyūbatwalīla koi ī mhola, hūna nabo baja ū kūlī ntemi Daūdi bakang'wīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nsūmba nebe akababona, ūng'wīla ū Abusalomu; na lūūlū a basūmba benabo būbīlī wabo bīnga wangū wangū, būja Bahulimu ha kaya ya ngosha ūmò walī na lwinzī ha gwalugwa yakwe, bika ng'wenūmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nke wa ngosha ng'wenūyo ūsola ikundīkījo ūkundīkīja a ha nomo gwa lwinzī, hūna wanikīla ho būsīga; yūbiza shilambū ū kūdeeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba ng'wa Abusalomu aho biza a halī nkīma ng'wenūyo būmūūja, “Baja halī a ba Ahimaazi nū Yonasani?” Ū nkīma ng'wene ūbashokeja, “Bakīlaga mongo.” Abo baalī batūng'wa būgema ū kūbakooba, alīyo batabapandīkile, būshoka Yelusalemu dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo baalī batūng'wa aho bīnga, a basūmba a babīlī benabo būfuma ū mu lwinzī, būja ū kūlī Daūdi būūkang'winha ī mhola. Būng'wīla, “Igolanyagi wangū mugūkīle ū mongo, nguno ū Ahisofeeli wīhelaga gīkī na gīkī ī mihayo ya kūng'wītīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi na a banhū pye abo baalī hamò nang'hwe būbūūka būgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani. Aho būleela ū būjikū walī atīho nūūlū ūmò ūyo walī ataalī ū kwīkīla ī Yolodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Ahisofeeli aho wabona gīkī ū mhayo gwakwe gwaleka ū kūlondeelwa, ūgolanya nzobe yakwe ūdamhīla ūja kū nzengo gwa ng'wawe; ūshika ūlonja lonja ya ha ng'wakwe, hanuma winija ūcha; ūjīkwa mu shigila sha ng'wa ise!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shoobi kūngunanha Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūja ūūkashika Mahanaimu; ū Abusalomu nang'hwe ūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani na a Baisilaeli a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abusalomu walī wamala kūnsola Amasa kūbiza ntaale wa mabità a ha ng'wanya go ng'wa Yoabu. Ū Amasa walī ng'witūnja wa Ng'wisilaeli nebe witanagwa Isila, walī wantoola nshīke o ng'wa Nahashi Abigaili, ng'wana wa ng'wawe na Seluya ū nina o ng'wa Yoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli nū Abusalomu būtūūla ng'hambī yabo mu Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho washika ī Mahanaimu, ūnsanga ho Shoobi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nahashi muna Laba ya Amoni, na Makili ng'witūnja o ng'wa Amieli muna Lodebaali, na Bazilai muna Logelimu ya Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo baalī bang'wīma nzīla ū Daūdi, biza na shilaalīlo na shiseme sha kūtūmamīla, mabakūli na nungū; hamò na ngano, būsīga, būsu, na shisuumo shikalangilwe, mahalage na nduulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na būūkī baalī nabo, na mabeelè galaalile, ng'holo, shibanda sha mashishanga galaalile. Ī shose shenīshi shalī sha kūlya ū Daūdi na a banhū abo baalī hamò nang'hwe. Nguno bakahaya, “Lyabanojaga ī litogolo a banhū, nū kūtuuba bigwaga, nī notà yabaminyaga!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
